  "prefLabel": "We 402.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "We 402.01 Purpose. The purpose of We 402 is to implement the requirements of RSA 482-B:5,V, which provides the mechanism for licensed pump installers to maintain standards of practice in their trade, including periodic amendments to the national electrical code, the international plumbing code and these rules.\n\nSource. #7307, eff 6-13-00; ss by #9179, eff 6-13-08; ss by #12083, eff 3-1-17 (See Revision Notes at Chapter headings for We 300 and We 600)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/we100-1000.html"
